apps/server/src/lib/replay
=============================

This library contains material derived from the following third-party work.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
wot-battle-results-parser (crate `wot_replay_parser`)
https://github.com/rajesh-rahul/wot-battle-results-parser
Commit 4905191fac7f5782b80bef00c5b462f64efa42af
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Ported to TypeScript (format knowledge, no verbatim code):
- the replay container layout (magic, JSON block table, 8-byte stream header);
- the Blowfish key and the ECB + 8-byte XOR chaining used on the packet stream;
- packet framing (payload size, type, clock) and the packet type numbers for
  entity create, entity method, position, game version and chat;
- the Position packet layout (credited there to Monstrofil/replays_unpack);
- the Vehicle method id table (showShooting / onHealthChanged /
  showDamageFromShot) for WG clients 0.9.12 - 1.26.1.1 and the argument layouts
  of those three methods.

Test fixtures copied unchanged from that repository's
`replay_parser/tests/parser_tests/test_input/`:
- _tests/fixtures/wg-1.26.0.2-full.wotreplay
  (was 1-1_26_0_2-14_siegfried_line-EU-full.wotreplay)
- _tests/fixtures/wg-1.14.1.3-incomplete.wotreplay
  (was 1-1_14_1_3-44_north_america-EU.wotreplay)

