- evido/wotreplay-parser (BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) 2015 Jan Temmerman):
  confirmed the 0xFFFFFFFF end-of-stream packet and the 0x07 property packet.
- uwuny/mtreplay-analyzer (AGPL-3.0): read only, to confirm that Lesta
